   "source_url": "https://landrec.msa.maryland.gov/",
   "office_address": "55 N. Court Street, Westminster, MD 21157-5155",
   "records_foia": null,
   "access": "Easy",
   "updates": "Daily",
   "verified": "Verified",
   "notes": "Mechanic's, IRS & state tax, HOA, child-support liens + lis pendens all live in the recorder index. Deeds can be viewed for free online through mdlandrec.net; account creation with Maryland State Archives is required. GOTCHA: tax and child-support liens are indexed against the PERSON, not the parcel - name-match to the assessor roll. Some or most land records are available on MDLANDREC.NET."
  },
